infra (10)
  deploy (4)
    deploy-flow — Merges to main build an image, deploy to staging, run smoke tests, then promote to production.
    deploy-freeze-window — Production promotions are blocked from Friday 14:00 to Monday 08:00 local time.
    image-tagging — Container images use the full git SHA as the tag; latest is never deployed.
    rollback-procedure — Re-deploy the previous image tag with helm rollback; never revert migrations in the same step.
  k8s (4)
    helm-values-layering — Charts merge values.yaml, values-<env>.yaml, then secret references, in that order.
    k8s-glossary-pdb — A PodDisruptionBudget caps how many replicas voluntary disruptions may take down at once.
    k8s-liveness-probe-timeout — A 5 second liveness timeout restarted pods during cold start; use a startupProbe inste…
    k8s-resource-limits — All Kubernetes containers set CPU and memory requests and limits; the admission policy reject…
  observability (2)
    alert-routing — Pages route by service label to the owning team; warnings go to the team channel only.
    log-format-json — All services emit one JSON object per line with ts, level, msg, and request_id fields.
